{"ID":"20240220132602-5dzmnts","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240220132602-5dzmnts","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240220132602-5dzmnts\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312172244-23txyvs\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312172227-wx8k10p\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:27,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312172245-ffc1818\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"【白通汤】\u0026amp;【白通加猪胆汁汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240312172245"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312172244-23txyvs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172244-23txyvs","updated":"20240312172244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第三百二十八条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172244-14vk67z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172244-14vk67z","updated":"20240312172244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「少阴病」，下利，「白通汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172244-0olju3h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172244-0olju3h","updated":"20240312172244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当我们去治利的时候，如果是脓血桃花汤。这个条辩的下痢是里面寒掉了，里面寒湿很盛。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172244-n2sh50y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172244-n2sh50y","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312172244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"白通汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312172244-ejo8sua","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172244-ejo8sua","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312172244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"葱白四茎。干姜一两。附子一枚，生用，去皮破八片。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312172244-u92rw0a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172244-u92rw0a","updated":"20240312172244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右三味，以水三升，煮取一升，去滓，分温再服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312172244-yqb7azd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172244-yqb7azd","updated":"20240312172244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"附子用的时候要用棉布包起来。附子一枚，大的差不多五钱，少的三钱也有。干姜一钱。葱白四茎，放在一起。三碗水煮成一碗。去下痢。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172244-64gvsza","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172244-64gvsza","updated":"20240312172244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么要用葱白，要"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"上下通利的时候我们会用葱白"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这里没有用炙甘草，炙甘草对下利没有什么帮助。这里会利，是因为寒湿，附子能够通神经，血脉，干姜能够温中去寒。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"寒利不止白通汤。热利不止桃花汤。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312172245-ffc1818","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172245-ffc1818"}},{"ID":"20240312172227-rlfvb8p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172227-rlfvb8p","updated":"20240312172227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第三百二十九条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172227-294bmjx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172227-294bmjx","updated":"20240312172227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「少阴病」，下利，脉微者，与「白通汤」。利不止，厥逆无脉，干呕烦者，「白通加猪胆汁汤」主之。服汤，脉暴出者死，微续者生。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172227-0twk9h2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172227-0twk9h2","updated":"20240312172227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脉微细都是少阴症，吃了白通汤，下痢还是没有停，这时候，手脚冰冷，更严重了，白通加猪胆汁汤。吃了这个汤，脉突然崩出来，代表阳绝了，都没救了，如果脉微微，慢慢回来的都会好。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172227-bt91d4l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172227-bt91d4l","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312172227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"白通加猪胆汁汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312172227-9rekilm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172227-9rekilm","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312172227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"葱白四茎。干姜一两。附子一枚，生用，去皮破八片。人尿五合。猪胆汁一合。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312172227-87fg3eq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172227-87fg3eq","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312172227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右三味，以水三升，煮取一升，去滓，纳胆汁、人尿，和令相得，分温再服，若无胆亦可用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312172227-x2s9puq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172227-x2s9puq","updated":"20240312172227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"煮的方法，前三味药，葱白、干姜一、附子。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"猪胆汁和人尿不煮的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。六碗煮两碗，加人尿小酒杯五杯，猪胆汁一碗。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172227-33jxqlq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172227-33jxqlq","updated":"20240312172227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"人尿又叫回龙汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。唐容川讲每天早上起来喝一杯回龙汤。比如山东人吃水饺，再喝水饺汤，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"原汤化原食"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"啊，就是这个水饺你吃下去它不消化啊，你喝这个水饺汤，就能把它消化掉。这是物的性。比如，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"吃鱼鱼骨头卡住了，过去的中医就把同一只鱼的骨头，用火烧焦黑，打碎变成灰，当药粉水冲下去，一阳一阴，一结合骨头就会掉下去，化掉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。人尿小便排出来的，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"要喝自己的尿"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，原汤化原食。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"猪胆汁内服帮助消化"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，因为胆没有功能了，暂时取代人的胆。人尿过去用童子尿，我的老师，他的腰闪到，自己没有把法扎针，他找童子，弄一泡尿回来，喝下去大概二十分钟，他感觉腰的活力很强，腰的命门的地方一直在动，痛开始慢慢舒缓下来，热力慢慢扩散开来，就好了。他说"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"童子尿很强，进到命门的地方，童子是纯阳的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172227-dnit9s9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172227-dnit9s9","updated":"20240312172227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7——5"}]},{"ID":"20240312172227-e9lifl6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172227-e9lifl6","updated":"20240312172227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"他有恢复命门火的功能"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，因为回龙汤。原汤化原食，人尿简单说就是帮助消化。猪胆汁也是帮助消化。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172227-g3lzar6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172227-g3lzar6","updated":"20240312172227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"张仲景在研究这个白通汤的时候，看这个症状，一般少阴病下痢的时候，脉微者，病人有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"少阴病下痢，脉微者，脉症相合"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。中医看病最怕脉症不和，明明人很虚，摸到脉很大，这都是危险。或者人很状，摸到脉很小，这都是脉症不和。脉症不和都是危险的症状。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172227-79jaymp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172227-79jaymp","updated":"20240312172227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"俗话，男怕脚肿，女怕头肿。当发现男是脚肿，女是头肿，是逆症危险的时候，知道他是危险的时候，病人没感觉，你摸他脉很小，脉证不合，说明生命已经很危险了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172227-iveov49","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172227-iveov49","updated":"20240312172227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这里脉症是相合的，白通汤就可以了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172227-z51mklh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172227-z51mklh","updated":"20240312172227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“利不止，厥逆无脉，干呕烦者，”里面里阳没有了，阴很盛，就会干呕，烦躁，手脚逆。这个时候，因为里面的阳没有了，阳是动能，消化能力没有了，所以会白通汤加上人尿，猪胆汁。要不要一搏？要一搏，到这个阶段无所谓了，还是试一试。如果吃下去，脉暴出者死，暴出就是身体不受药了，不接受药了，如果是微续的，慢慢回来，表示身体在继续接受药。所以如果遇到危症的时候，脉是慢慢回来的，都是很好的现象，可以一搏。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172227-qrpj6qa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172227-qrpj6qa","updated":"20240312172227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"后面张仲景说找不到胆汁的话，人尿就可以了。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312172227-wx8k10p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172227-wx8k10p","updated":"20240312172227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"看药典的时候，人尿童子尿专门治跌打损伤。腰痛，强烈的腰痛。"}]}]}